# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GROUPING SETS
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# At the top level of GROUPING SETS, an unparenthesized ** produces one
# singleton grouping set per column, after any sets listed before it.
# Parentheses around the operand, as in **(cols), make no difference.
